<title>UK: Credit Local sets 400 mln Dkr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 400 mln Dkr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, BIL and CCB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE   S28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
